  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building justice and peace through GENDER EQUALITY in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GENDER EQUALITY will ensure equal power relations between men and women in the community. Young women aged 15-30 will be mobilsed in peacemaker groups, and receive training on advocacy, leadership and Sexual and Reproductive Health and Rights. Through the trainings, young women will be able to participate in, contribute to and benefit from social and political development. Through Safe spaces the young women will be able to share their own challenges and experiences in a supportive environment.</narrative>
  </description>
